WEBVTT

00:06:29.385 --> 00:06:30.886
Oh, thank you.

00:06:30.928 --> 00:06:33.514
A "woo" for the pronunciation,
I was worried about it.

00:06:33.556 --> 00:06:36.725
(Laughter)

00:06:36.725 --> 00:06:39.145
Now I know all
of y'all's kids are obsessed

00:06:39.186 --> 00:06:41.981
with those nori seaweed snacks,

00:06:41.981 --> 00:06:44.024
so why not kick it up a notch --

00:06:44.066 --> 00:06:45.443
Sorry --

00:06:45.484 --> 00:06:50.364
(Laughter)

00:06:50.406 --> 00:06:54.285
With a locally foraged
ingredient: bull kelp.

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:57.079
I foraged this right here in Vancouver.

00:06:57.538 --> 00:07:01.625
(Applause and cheers)